LUMA SUMMARY:
Sir Sic/PragerU transcript discussion becomes an architecture lesson. Cozmo observes that even flawed material can contain useful ideas; the team connects that to the no-token breakthrough: the Duck should deliver responses rather than judge meaning. The session closes with the clearest statement yet of the parserless 2.0 principle.
